  "description": "Cavil Sernua is the bastard son of House Sernua and the male lead of this story. His story begins in an orphanage, but he soon grows up to be a respectable figure who's loved by all. The villainess is Cavil's wife, Elodi McClaire, the character I transmigrated into. Elodi is cruel and evil, and she met her tragic ending in the book. However, I will not follow in her footsteps. Instead, I will raise Cavil well and divorce him so he can end up with his true love. Well, that is... if he'll let me.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
